      "worked_solution": "The figure consists of $4$ rows, and each row has $6$ cubes.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132963/assets/95903749fc41234c51b583f86133efda1a5044b91863afc2bcd280fe795b196d.png)\n\nSo, there are $6\\times 4=24$ cubes in total.\n\nTherefore, the volume of the figure is $24$ cubic centimeters.",
