      "worked_solution": "The figure consists of three layers:\n\n- The bottom layer consists of $5$ cubes.\n\n- The middle layer consists of $2$ cubes.\n\n- The top layer consists of $1$ cube.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132963/assets/4c599974e433fc47472089970e93e6435b984a1c4ad991e305bb257e395d2cad.png)\n\nTherefore, the volume is $5+2+1=8$ cubic centimeters.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
