      "worked_solution": "The figure consists of three layers:\n\n- The bottom layer consists of $6$ cubes.\n\n- The middle layer consists of $3$ cubes.\n\n- The top layer consists of $1$ cube.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132963/assets/823da54c38a1405be191e781b8753b5615bb12798f07e3ca6d0f9a725226a84e.png)\n\nTherefore, the volume is $6+3+1=10$ cubic inches.",
